@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 160
hide empty members
title 类图（一）：核心票务领域
class "账号 User" as User {
  +id: UUID
  +role: Role（固定四选一）
  +phoneIdentityId: UUID [0..1]
  +passwordHash: String
  +deletedAt: DateTime [0..1]
}
class "活动 Event" as Event {
  +id: UUID
  +status: EventStatus
  +categoryNameSnapshot: String
  +publishedAt: DateTime [0..1]
  +terminatedAt: DateTime [0..1]
  +submit()
  +publish()
  +terminate(reason)
}
class "类别 Category" as Category {
  +id: UUID
  +name: String
  +enabled: Boolean
}
class "场次 EventSession" as Session {
  +id: UUID
  +name: String
  +startsAt, endsAt: DateTime
  +salesOpensAt, registrationClosesAt: DateTime
  +location: String
  +capacity: Integer
}
class "票种 TicketType" as Type {
  +id: UUID
  +name: String
  +capacity: Integer
  +priceJiao: Integer
  +saleStopped: Boolean
  +/occupied, /remaining: Integer
}
class "报名单 RegistrationOrder" as Order {
  +id, requestId: UUID
  +requestFingerprint: String
  +status: OrderStatus
  +nameSnapshot: String
  +amountJiaoSnapshot: Integer
  +createdAt: DateTime
  +confirmDeadline, payDeadline: DateTime [0..1]
  +consecutiveFailures: Integer
  +confirmPromotion()
  +cancel()
}
class "支付尝试 PaymentAttempt" as Payment {
  +id, attemptId: UUID
  +result: Success | Failure
  +amountJiao: Integer
  +createdAt: DateTime
  +failureReason: String [0..1]
}
class "退款依据 RefundRequest" as Request {
  +id: UUID
  +source: User | PlatformTermination
  +acceptedAt: DateTime
  +eligibilitySnapshot: String
  +revokedAt: DateTime [0..1]
}
class "退款尝试 RefundAttempt" as Refund {
  +id: UUID
  +result: Success | Failure
  +amountJiao: Integer
  +createdAt: DateTime
  +failureReason: String [0..1]
}
class "电子票 Ticket" as Ticket {
  +id: UUID（全局唯一）
  +status: Valid | Checked | Invalid
  +downloadText()
}
class "签到 CheckIn" as CheckIn {
  +id: UUID
  +checkedAt: DateTime
  +checkerId: UUID
  +sessionIdSnapshot: UUID
}
class "当前检票授权 CheckerAssignment" as Grant {
  +id: UUID
  +assignedAt: DateTime
}
User "1" -- "0..*" Event : 组织者创建 >
Category "0..1" -- "0..*" Event
Event "1" *-- "0..20" Session
Session "1" *-- "0..10" Type
User "1" -- "0..*" Order : 参与者本人 >
Session "1" -- "0..*" Order
Type "1" -- "0..*" Order
Order "1" -- "0..*" Payment
Order "1" -- "0..*" Request
Request "1" -- "0..*" Refund
Payment "1" -- "0..*" Refund : 原成功支付 >
Order "1" -- "0..1" Ticket
Ticket "1" -- "0..1" CheckIn
User "1" -- "0..1" Grant : 检票员 >
Session "1" -- "0..*" Grant
User "1" -- "0..*" CheckIn : 历史执行者 >
note bottom of Order
  有效订单：候补中、递补待确认、未支付、已报名、已签到。
  用户+场次最多1有效订单；跨场有效订单时间不得重叠。
  用户+报名requestId唯一，参数变化拒绝；重报用新编号。
  每单最多1成功支付、1成功退款、1票、1签到。
  候补直接复用报名单，不再创建另一套候补状态实体。
end note
note bottom of Type
  已占=未支付+递补待确认+成功出票且未退款（含完成/缺席）。
  剩余=容量-已占>=0；支付和递补确认不重复扣库存。
  票种必须属于订单场次；容量和剩余不是独立人工维护值。
end note
note top of Event
  草稿可含0场/0票种；提交后活动1～20场、每场1～10票种。
  草稿可未选类别，提交必须关联1个有效类别。
  各票种容量之和<=场次容量。组合关系不代表物理级联删除。
  一个账号固定一个角色，以关联端约束角色而非继承多种身份。
end note
note bottom of Grant
  当前最多授权一场；改绑不改历史签到归属。
  已发布未终止场次至少1个可用检票账号。
end note
legend bottom
  结构性图；REQ-001、004～005、009～018、028、031、034～040、044～045。
  UUID、类名、方法和数据库约束实现方式为设计选择。
endlegend
@enduml

